### User Register

POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "example123",
    "password": "example123"
}

### User Login
POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "example123",
    "password": "example123"
}

### User Refresh Token
POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{refresh_token}}


### User create blog

POST {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/blog/new-blog
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

{
    "Title": "Example1",
    "Description": "Testing",
    "Content": "Testing"
}


### Get all blog from current user
GET {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/blog/all-blog?PageSize=1000&PageIndex=1
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{access_token}}


### Get single blog from user/or current user

GET {{vsa_w_controller_csharp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vsac/blog/read/019ecc2d-9963-741c-a6c7-410e1151479f
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{access_token}}